# SXE resources of the native form. See docs/userland/SXE_FORMAT.md.
#
# With a category it is listed in the menu like any app, under Diagnostics
# beside the other test programs. subsystem=native is informational: the
# loader goes by EI_OSABI, which --native stamps. No icon: it uses the generic
# one, like the ports without art.
name=Native widgets
description=Interactive native form: label, button and field (no POSIX)
version=system
vendor=SavanXP
subsystem=native
category=Diagnostics
